cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use FragEvoLab in your work, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "FragEvoLab: evolutionary molecular generation and docking"
version: "3.1.4"
authors:
  - family-names: "Karhanin"
    given-names: "Kirill V."
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  FragEvoLab provides fragment-based evolutionary molecular generation,
  configurable atom-level and fragment-level mutations, adaptive weights,
  target and off-target docking objectives, calculation caching, checkpoints,
  and reports. AutoDock Vina is used as an external docking executable.
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - evolutionary molecular design
  - molecular docking
  - fragment-based generation
